<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please read the directions carefully and complete the appropriate Course Override Form found <a href="https://physics.asu.edu/content/course-override-form">here</a>. You can also locate the form under the current students tab, titled "Course Override Form" on the Department of Physics <a href="physics.asu.edu">site</a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Once your override has been received it will be processed within 24-48 hours.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Department of Physics</font></div><div><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div>]]></td>
